      "content": "It is absolutely reasonable to want the heavy feeling to stop, and you are not alone in feeling this profound numbness. When the \"nothing\" feels this heavy, it suggests a need for deeper exploration than just a quick fix. Instead of focusing on a label, perhaps you could look into existential therapies that focus on meaning and purpose in a way that honors your current experience. Remember that even the quietest parts of yourself deserve to be heard.",
